    <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/934866a7-39f5-418f-8edb-65d62fbd6f96-01/AwardCriterion$_PriorInformationNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot4_TenderingTerms1_AwardingTerms1_AwardingCriterion1_SubordinateAwardingCriterion2>,
